ection":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"管理下屬，恩威並濟","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"言出必行，做事果斷","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「淳于恭，北海人。人有盜刈1恭禾者，恭見之，念其愧，因伏草中，至去乃起。」根據這則故事，下列敘述何者最恰當？","n":54,"ssz":"......................................................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當時五穀歉收，盜賊四處搶糧","n":13,"ssz":"..........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"淳于恭個性溫厚寬容，能體恤他人","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"北海地區盜賊兇悍，人民不敢與之對抗","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"淳于恭伏於草中，乃心中有愧，不欲見人","n":18,"ssz":"..............1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"據「陸公買硯」一文，下列關於故事中人物的敘述，何者最恰當？","n":29,"ssz":".......2....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"門人買錯硯臺卻不知道","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"陸公惋惜是因為石工技藝不佳","n":13,"ssz":"......1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"門人請人磨平硯眼是自作聰明","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"陸公對門人購硯的價格感到驚訝","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列何者不可能是「陸公買硯」一文的寓意？","n":20,"ssz":"..............2....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不聽老人言，吃虧在眼前","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"即使是好心也可能辦壞事","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知人善任才不會反受其害","n":11,"ssz":".....1....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"託人辦事，一定要先清楚溝通","n":13,"ssz":".....1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪一選項的閩南語俗諺可以形容課文中的僕人？","n":23,"ssz":"...2..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"痟貪軁雞籠","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"好心予雷唚","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"目睭花花，匏仔看做菜瓜","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[5].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"生雞卵的無，放雞屎的一大堆","n":13,"ssz":"..........1.."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（字元樣式 aff）＋ **紅筆斷句「/」與圈補主語的紅框**（19 個紅色圖形）\n＋ 綠色螢光標示（動詞／形容詞）。紅筆與螢光都是圖形，主語文字本身在文字層。","n":84,"ssz":"...................................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色手寫（字元樣式 aff）＋ **紅筆斷句「/」與圈補主語的紅框**（19 個紅色圖形）","n":45,"ssz":"............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.answer_carrier#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＋ 綠色螢光標示（動詞／形容詞）。紅筆與螢光都是圖形，主語文字本身在文字層。","n":38,"ssz":"......................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在「不量田」一課，我們學習如何判讀主語、補主語。現在，我們要在這基礎上再學一點小技巧——斷句。\n想想：一大塊食物沒辦法一口吞下，我們會怎麼做呢？拿刀切一小塊一小塊吃，是不是容易多了；長一點的文章也是這樣，我們可以利用斷句將一大段的文字變成一句句，這樣就「好讀」多了？","n":133,"ssz":"..1...1..............................2.............1.......2...............2..2.....1.......2..................1.......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在「不量田」一課，我們學習如何判讀主語、補主語。現在，我們要在這基礎上再學一點小技巧——斷句。","n":47,"ssz":"..1...1..............................2........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想想：一大塊食物沒辦法一口吞下，我們會怎麼做呢？拿刀切一小塊一小塊吃，是不是容易多了；長一點的文章也是這樣，我們可以利用斷句將一大段的文字變成一句句，這樣就「好讀」多了？","n":85,"ssz":"...1.......2...............2..2.....1.......2..................1.......1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一、斷句的具體作法","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"看到句號。或問號？，就在後面畫「/」，表示斷句的地方","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"以課文示範的斷句圖","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].content","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"課文第 1 段的三個分句，句末各畫一道紅色「／」斷句記號（共 3 道）。","n":36,"ssz":".........1.......1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[3].shows_sentences_from","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"classical_text.paragraphs[0]（原文第 1 段，逐字內容在那裡受檢）","n":47,"ssz":"..............................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"斷句後，一大段的文字會變成3個句子，分好的句子，我們稱它為「分句」。但仔細觀察，只有分句1有主語，其他的句子都沒有，此時，我們可以配合還原省略主語的步驟(找動詞、形容詞)往前找最近的主語，或是依照文意脈絡補上合理的主語，具體思路如下：","n":117,"ssz":"....1...........1.....1..............................1.............1................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圈補主語的思路圖","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].content","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.誰在京城待用?\n2.依文意脈絡，陸公派門人去買，買東西回來的自然是「門人」。","n":40,"ssz":"........................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].content#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.誰在京城待用?","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].content#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.依文意脈絡，陸公派門人去買，買東西回來的自然是「門人」。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].annotation_marks","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圖上把課文第 1 段重排兩次：上半在動詞上方用紅字補主語（陸／陸／陸），動詞用灰底標出；\n下半改寫成「(陸)議價未定／(陸)既還邸,(陸)使門人往,(門人)以一金易歸／」的形式，\n並用藍色箭頭指向右側那兩條註記。","n":106,"ssz":"...............................................................................2.........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].annotation_marks#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圖上把課文第 1 段重排兩次：上半在動詞上方用紅字補主語（陸／陸／陸），動詞用灰底標出；","n":44,"ssz":"............................................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].annotation_marks#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下半改寫成「(陸)議價未定／(陸)既還邸,(陸)使門人往,(門人)以一金易歸／」的形式，","n":44,"ssz":"..................................2........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[5].annotation_marks#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"並用藍色箭頭指向右側那兩條註記。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀時可以這樣表示\n總結文言文圈補主語步驟","n":21,"ssz":"....................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀時可以這樣表示","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[6].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"總結文言文圈補主語步驟","n":11,"ssz":"..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.斷句，看到「句號。」或「問號？」就畫/。\n2.找動詞(包括有/沒有、是/不是)或形容詞。\n3.\t判斷是「誰做什麼」、「誰怎麼樣」、「誰有/沒有」、「誰是/不是」以確認主語。\n4.如果句子沒有主語，就往前找最近的主語，或是依照文意脈絡補上合理的主語","n":125,"ssz":"......................................1........................................1..............1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.斷句，看到「句號。」或「問號？」就畫/。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.找動詞(包括有/沒有、是/不是)或形容詞。","n":23,"ssz":"...............1......."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3.\t判斷是「誰做什麼」、「誰怎麼樣」、「誰有/沒有」、「誰是/不是」以確認主語。","n":41,"ssz":"................................1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[7].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"4.如果句子沒有主語，就往前找最近的主語，或是依照文意脈絡補上合理的主語","n":36,"ssz":".....1.............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[8].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二、換你試試看：請依「文言文圈補主語步驟」閱讀下文並完成練習","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習一","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注1：裨將，副將。裨，音ㄆㄧˊ。","n":16,"ssz":"...1...1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注2：矢，箭。矢，音ㄕˇ。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注3：膜，指肌肉。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注4：謝，酬勞。","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[4]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注5：鏃，箭鏃，箭頭。鏃，音ㄗㄨˊ。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].annotations[5]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注6：不意，不該","n":8,"ssz":"...1...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].teacher_note_carrier","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"橘色文字方塊（字元樣式），印在原文右側","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.斷句。用紅筆在上文句號「。」或問號「?」的地方畫 /。\n2.參考①、②的作法，完成③-⑤題：用螢光筆標示出動詞或形容詞，並圈補主語","n":67,"ssz":"..................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"1.斷句。用紅筆在上文句號「。」或問號「?」的地方畫 /。","n":29,"ssz":"............................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"2.參考①、②的作法，完成③-⑤題：用螢光筆標示出動詞或形容詞，並圈補主語","n":37,"ssz":"....................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].passage_figure.referent","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習一原文（已畫紅筆斷句）","n":13,"ssz":"..2.........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].passage_figure.content","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習一的五個句子連排成一段，句末共畫 5 道紅色「／」斷句記號。\n圖上第四句印的是「鏃⁵在膜內，須亟治」（與注 5 一致）。","n":62,"ssz":".....1.1...1..............................................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].passage_figure.content#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"練習一的五個句子連排成一段，句末共畫 5 道紅色「／」斷句記號。","n":32,"ssz":".....1.1...1...................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].passage_figure.content#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"圖上第四句印的是「鏃⁵在膜內，須亟治」（與注 5 一致）。","n":29,"ssz":".........................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].passage_figure.shows_sentences_from","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"spotlight 練習一的 items ①~⑤（逐字內容在那裡受檢）","n":35,"ssz":"..................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「有醫者，自稱善外科。」","n":12,"ssz":"............"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[0].subjects[0].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"自稱善外科","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[0].subjects[0].subject","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫者","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[1].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裨將曰：「鏃在膜內者，須亟治。」","n":16,"ssz":"1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[1].source_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裨將曰：「簇在膜內者，須亟治。」","n":16,"ssz":"1..............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[1].subjects[0].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"須亟治","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[1].subjects[0].subject","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"我","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「一裨將陣回，中流矢，深入膜內，延使治。」","n":21,"ssz":"..1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].subjects[0].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"陣回","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].subjects[0].subject","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裨將","n":2,"ssz":"1."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].subjects[1].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"深入膜內","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].subjects[1].subject","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"矢","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[2].subjects[2].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"延使治","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[3].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"乃持并州剪，剪去矢管，跪而請謝。","n":16,"ssz":"..1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[3].subjects[0].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"乃持并州剪","n":5,"ssz":"..1.."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[3].subjects[1].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"剪去矢管","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[3].subjects[2].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"跪","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[3].subjects[3].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請謝","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[4].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫曰：「此內科事，不意並責我！」","n":16,"ssz":".........1......"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[4].subjects[0].verb_phrase","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"此內科事","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[9].items[4].subjects[0].subject","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"此/這件事","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3. 閱讀理解測驗\n關於本文，下列敘述何者正確？","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"3. 閱讀理解測驗","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].prompt#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"關於本文，下列敘述何者正確？","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.A","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫者治好裨將的傷，但裨將不滿意，醫者只好跪地求饒","n":24,"ssz":"....1.....1............."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.B","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫者剪去箭桿，治好裨將的傷，裨將因此跪地感謝他","n":23,"ssz":".........1....1........"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.C","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雖然醫者醫術高明，但為人廉潔，只收取合理的酬勞","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[10].options.D","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"醫者認為自己剪去箭桿後，手術已完成，所以要求酬勞","n":24,"ssz":"....................1..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].label","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"挑戰題","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].value","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"王夷甫雅尚玄遠，常嫉1其婦貪濁，口未嘗言「錢」字。婦欲試之，令婢以錢遶床，不得行。夷甫晨起，見錢閡2行，呼婢曰：「舉卻3阿堵物。」","n":65,"ssz":"......................................1.........................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].annotations[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注1：嫉，厭惡、憎恨。嫉，音ㄐㄧˊ。","n":18,"ssz":"......1..........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].annotations[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注2：閡，阻隔、妨礙。閡，音ㄏㄜˊ。","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].annotations[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"注3：舉卻，拿開。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀完上文後，完成以下任務。\n1.斷句。用紅筆在上文句號「。」或問號「?」的地方畫 /\n2.用螢光筆標示出動詞或形容詞，並圈補主語\n3.閱讀理解測驗","n":73,"ssz":"........................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[11].instruction#line","slug":null,"idx":n